WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.292
So... what's your plan, Mr. Garrett?

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.417
How would you like to buy a bank?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.917
What the hell do we know about banking?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.125
Owning a bank is like owning the other
side of the real estate business.

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.750
There's a few complexities
you just left out.

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:17.167
-Like what?
-I'm sorry.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.625
Did I not wake up black this morning?

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:20.250
'Cause I'm pretty sure I did.

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:22.583
Yep, still black.

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.875
I came here to try my hand at real estate.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.208
You married a millionaire, Eunice?

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.208
I like seeing black men succeed.

00:00:38.292 --> 00:00:41.708
Sometimes I even invest
some of my own money to back 'em.

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:43.292
I know you're smart and ambitious.

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.208
You and I both know that's not enough.

00:00:45.292 --> 00:00:47.375
It is time that someone
shine a bright light on that

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:49.000
in order for things to change.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:54.000
Are you starting to buy real estate
in white-only neighborhoods?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.583
Think about all the good we can do
for the community.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.917
Taking it to the man.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.583
That's exactly what we're gonna do.

00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:11.417
And just how in the hell
do you plan on pulling that off?

00:01:12.417 --> 00:01:14.167
We get Matt to front for us.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.375
You want me to what?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.542
Be us to the rest of the world.

00:01:18.542 --> 00:01:21.083
We can't set foot in the bank
unless we're the help.

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:24.875
Should've took limo driver
when you had the chance.

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:28.500
I don't know anything about banking.
I don't know how to buy a bank.

00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:30.792
We'll teach you everything
you need to know.

00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:34.042
You gotta learn how to talk
to rich white folks like you one of 'em.

00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:35.583
And you can't fake a golf game.

00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:40.167
Make me proud, son.

00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:45.333
The whole country's talkin' about
how two Negroes managed to buy two banks

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:48.500
full of white folks' money
and loan it to other Negroes.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.583
You should've known
you couldn't keep this a secret very long.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:54.042
FBI, you're under arrest.

00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:56.958
A black man tries to bring
other brothers up, that's intolerable.

00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:07.708
Even a rigged game's fun to play, Bernard.

00:02:07.792 --> 00:02:11.000
If this was easy, somebody else
would have done it a long time ago.

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:15.667
You a revolutionary.

